## Rebuilding

`pono-bin` was built from @SOURCE@ with

    ./configure.sh @CONFIGURE_FLAGS@
    cmake --build build

after setting up the dependencies as Pono's README describes, at the versions
the table above lists.

@IF_MATHSAT@
MathSAT is not part of the source: `ci-scripts/setup-msat.sh` downloads it
into `deps/mathsat` once you accept its license.

@END_MATHSAT@
Rebuilding is also how to link the binary against modified versions of its
LGPL-licensed libraries, as their licenses permit.
